WEBVTT

00:09:24.476 --> 00:09:30.691
To fix this and move toward a world
without immigration prisons,

00:09:30.691 --> 00:09:34.445
let's stop paying
CoreCivic and the GEO Group

00:09:34.486 --> 00:09:36.905
to lock up migrants,

00:09:36.947 --> 00:09:40.909
and let's start paying lawyers
to defend them.

00:09:41.327 --> 00:09:48.292
(Cheers and applause)

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:54.882
Having a lawyer just means that the courts
are more likely to reach

00:09:54.923 --> 00:09:58.010
a fair and a just conclusion.

00:09:59.303 --> 00:10:03.098
And when it comes
to important legal questions,